### Advisory findings only — no blocking issues → submit with event `APPROVE`:

```
**EA Review — Application Domain** ✅ Approved with Notes

**Summary**: {one sentence describing what the PR does}

**Advisory**:
- **{Category}** — {specific finding referencing the affected artifact, file, or section}. {Concrete guidance that improves alignment without requiring scope changes.}

{Repeat for each advisory finding.}

{If a domain definition gap was identified:}
> ⚠️ **Domain Gap** — {what this PR exposes that is not reflected in the domain definition}. Recommend tracking as a follow-up EA work item.
```
